# integrify/core reads no environment variables of its own — configuration is passed
# to each client as an immutable value object.
#
# Each integration package documents its own variables in its README and reads them
# through a `fromEnvironment()` named constructor. Example, once such a package exists:
#
# EPOINT_PUBLIC_KEY=
# EPOINT_PRIVATE_KEY=
# APP_ENV=test          # test | testing | sandbox | dev | development | local
#                       # prod | production | live
